{"slug":"lil-wayne-claps-back-at-mavs-mark-cuban-with-now-deleted-tweet-skip-bayless-chimes-in-with-mark-cuban-is-a-joke","postId":74565,"title":"Lil Wayne Claps Back At Mavs' Mark Cuban With Now Deleted Tweet & Skip Bayless Chimes In With, \"Mark Cuban Is A Joke \"","htmlContent":"<!-- wp:image {\"id\":515876,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/R-24-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-515876\"/><figcaption>Page Six</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Earlier this week <a href=\"https://landonbuford.com/2022/05/16/mavs-mark-cuban-responds-to-suns-fan-lil-wayne-calling-luka-doncic-a-h/\">Mark Cuban responded</a> to Lil Wayne calling Luka Doncic a h* after game four of the Western Conference Semifinals between the Dallas Mavericks and Phoenix Suns. By quoting a line by “It’s a s*** show, put you front row.”</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The line is from Wayne’s single ‘Uproar’ featuring Swizz Beatz.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://www.instagram.com/p/Cdoaw7muclo/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"instagram\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-instagram wp-block-embed-instagram\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://www.instagram.com/p/Cdoaw7muclo/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p> Well, It didn't take Wayne long to respond to the Dallas Mavericks Governor. In a now deleted tweet, Lil Tunechi tweeted the message that reads, \"Mark Cuban don't make me get you smacked boy. U playin w me?? I will piss in ya fkn mouth h*\"</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/LegionHoops/status/1526779179588390912?s=20u0026t=MQPNGPGohOYWTyG39uQquQ\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/LegionHoops/status/1526779179588390912?s=20&amp;t=MQPNGPGohOYWTyG39uQquQ\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>After deleting it, he tweeted, ya lil b*** it's  up.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/LilTunechi/status/1526775228562481153?s=20u0026t=MQPNGPGohOYWTyG39uQquQ\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/LilTunechi/status/1526775228562481153?s=20&amp;t=MQPNGPGohOYWTyG39uQquQ\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It didn't take long for Skip Bayless to add his two cents calling Cuban 'a joke'</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/RealSkipBayless/status/1526769833018216448?s=20u0026t=MQPNGPGohOYWTyG39uQquQ\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/RealSkipBayless/status/1526769833018216448?s=20&amp;t=MQPNGPGohOYWTyG39uQquQ\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The last time Skip Bayless criticized Luka Doncic, Cuban told Fantatics View, \"Does he  still have a show?\"</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Cz8zL-Mpqzs\",\"type\":\"video\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"youtube\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Cz8zL-Mpqzs\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Speaking of Lil Wayne, according to Skip Bayless, he was a witness to Monty Williams and DeAndre Ayton heated exchange after Ayton was subbed out for Bismack Biyombo. He would not return to the game. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/PHXMRORNG/status/1526011013065105408?s=20u0026t=7hr9cWVZXceJxFRmiOoROg\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/PHXMRORNG/status/1526011013065105408?s=20&amp;t=7hr9cWVZXceJxFRmiOoROg\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>“This, from what I was told, got really ugly,” Bayless explained. “From what our man Lil Wayne told me…I think he either heard it or could lip-read. Monty got so upset with Ayton that he said, ‘You fricking quit on us.’ And that led to an exchange where each Monty and Ayton had to be restrained from going at each other.”</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/ClutchPointsApp/status/1526217782748127233?s=20u0026t=DixXL7eLMhc5MxQ7PEkyTg\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/ClutchPointsApp/status/1526217782748127233?s=20&amp;t=DixXL7eLMhc5MxQ7PEkyTg\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Meanwhile, Dallas is getting ready for game one of the Western Conference Finals against the Golden State Warriors. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->","excerpt":"Page Six Earlier this week Mark Cuban responded to Lil Wayne calling Luka Doncic a h* after game four of the Western Conference Semifinals between the Dallas Mavericks and Phoenix Suns. By quoting a…","publishedAt":"2022-05-18T05:00:00Z","modifiedAt":"2022-05-18T05:00:00Z","author":{"slug":"tony-mcknight","displayName":"Tony McKnight"},"categories":[{"slug":"sports","name":"Sports"}],"tags":[{"slug":"byron-nelson","name":"Byron Nelson"},{"slug":"dallas-mavericks","name":"Dallas Mavericks"},{"slug":"landon-buford","name":"Landon Buford"},{"slug":"lil-wayne","name":"Lil Wayne"},{"slug":"luka-doncic","name":"Luka Dončić"},{"slug":"mark-cuban","name":"Mark Cuban"},{"slug":"phoenix-suns","name":"phoenix suns"},{"slug":"skip-bayless","name":"Skip Bayless"}],"heroImage":{"originalUrl":"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/R-24-1024x683.jpg"},"inlineImageUrls":["http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/R-24-1024x683.jpg"],"readingTimeMin":1,"type":"post","link":"https://landonbuford.com/lil-wayne-claps-back-at-mavs-mark-cuban-with-now-deleted-tweet-skip-bayless-chimes-in-with-mark-cuban-is-a-joke/"}